WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.390
A Demon Agent?

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.350
So if we can find the line
that connects up...

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:09.110
we might be able to mobilize
before the Demon Hazard even happens.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:13.780
It was not revenge
by the Demonically Possessed.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.740
He was silenced by another human.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.740
Subject: About the case you inquired
About the D Hazard
which occurred at 15:55 today at
the Legeston Hotel Bayron.
We report to you
that 4 out of the 5
conditions your office
designated were met.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.950
MR. SHU OGATA

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.700
It's highly likely that the mysterious informant
who's providing you with information...

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.080
is working based on a demon's will.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.790
The suspect list has narrowed down
significantly in my head.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.020
LOOKS LIKE ONE MORE WILL DO...

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:20.160
I&S OFFICE
SHU OGATA

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:20.160
DEMON AGENT
MURDER CASE
INVESTIGATION
HEADQUARTERS

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:24.080
EPISODE 8
THE UNWANTED TRUTH

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.910
With the incident involving the Celestial Abbey,

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.410
a bit of time has elapsed,

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.210
JUNYA
HANAMURA
= AGENT

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.210
DEMON

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.210
DEMON AGENT MURDER CASE

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.210
but this is the current report concerning
the investigation of Junya Hanamura's murder.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.710
JUNYA HANAMURA = AGENT

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.550
Junya Hanamura found humans harboring
desire or hatred and cleverly enticed them

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.550
so he could be the mediator
for a contract with a demon.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.850
MEDIATION

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.850
JUNYA HANAMURA = AGENT

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.850
In other words,
his position was that of an agent.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:49.390
However, the moment
his true identity was known by the police,

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.190
he was killed before we could step in.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:56.570
Without a doubt, this is the doing of a demon
who's active behind the scenes of this city.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:59.240
But the issue is that
from the weapons and the methods,

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.410
we believe this is being done
by the hands of a human.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.870
That means that between
this Junya guy and a demon,

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.250
there's another human
who acts as another mediator.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.120
Yes.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.170
For convenience...

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.290
we'll call this individual the "True Agent."

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:18.920
TRUE AGENT
MURDER

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.920
This True Agent not only had
Junya Hanamura...

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.050
but has many other agents
at his disposal

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.180
and is working behind the scenes
to fulfill the demon's objective.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.560
This guy sounds like an executive
in multi-level marketing.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:33.230
Right. And seeing how quickly
he reacted by murdering Junya Hanamura,

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:38.440
he's likely very familiar with information
from either the police or the government.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:43.200
Therefore, this guy is in the police force
or a higher-up in the government?

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:49.330
Just like the informant who was dishing out
information about Demon Hazards to you, Mr. Ogata.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.330
TRUE AGENT = INFORMANT X

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:53.330
TRUE AGENT = INFORMANT X

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.330
So the True Agent and Informant X
are the same person?

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.420
That possibility is very likely.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:02.050
More than anything, I don't want to think
there are two traitors in the top tier of this city.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.720
Which means that this guy created
the Demonically Possessed...

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.350
but also had Shu and Kisara
get rid of them?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.020
Exactly for what purpose?

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:16.560
If we can figure out that purpose,
we'll get one step closer to the True Agent.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.110
Mr. Ogata...

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.020
Hmm?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:24.780
How did you get to know this informant
and how did you two begin contacting each other?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:25.990
Huh?

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.870
Do you have any clues about his identity?

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.790
Let's see.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.620
Do I?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.460
Come on now, Shu!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.920
Have you already gone senile
at your young age?

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.800
Come on, get a grip!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.230
DEMON AGENT MURDER CASE
INVESTIGATION HEADQUARTERS

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.110
These are the suspects who are on my list.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.490
For now, I've whittled it down to four.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.030
All of these names are rather alarming.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.410
<i>But these are the only individuals</i>

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:16.210
<i>who found out Junya Hanamura was being
investigated right around the time I did.</i>

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.930
SUSPECT CANDIDATES
* High-ranking government officials
(Mayor and deputy mayors)
* Police Agency higher-ups
(Director General)
* Anti-Demon Bureau
(Chief Ashiya)
* AAA (Akino Yugiri and Ayano Yugiri)

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.930
If it's one of these,
the perpetrator is obvious.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:30.550
Huh?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.600
Ayano Yugiri

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.600
This one!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.230
No, no, no! Hold it!
Wait a minute!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.690
She's the least likely of them all!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:46.450
But Ms. Akino Yugiri used to be
Chief Ashiya's boss back in the Police Agency,

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.620
and she was deeply involved
in the creation of the Anti-Demon Bureau.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:53.160
To remove this family from
the possibilities at this point in time—

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.330
No, no!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.750
Hey Shu, there was some strange car—

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.750
That doesn't mean...

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.420
Ayano's working for a demon!

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.500
Huh?

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.630
Right?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.380
* AAA (Akino Yugiri, Ayano Yugiri)

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.760
Jeez, what's with this
completely irrelevant list of suspects?

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.470
W-Well, I mean...

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.760
Right?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:18.190
This simply listed up every single person
who had any possibility.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:24.940
I... I was the opposite
and saying "This might not be right!"

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.190
Nope.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.900
There's more than enough possibility.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.740
That's right.
How she approached Shu...

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.200
was all at the will of the demon.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:37.250
The reason you're here is also the will of a demon!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.910
Well, eat up.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.130
This is all paid for by the police.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.090
I was suddenly called out here...

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.140
only to be just as suddenly
put on a suspect list?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.850
You really are straying off course.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.140
<i>Tell them! Tell them more of that!</i>

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:02.860
<i>Well, I was going to do some investigating
to lock in a suspect a bit more,</i>

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.150
<i>then have them
make a voluntary appearance.</i>

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.900
And yet, you still don't plan
on removing us from the suspect list.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.660
Th-Then, we'll take this opportunity to ask.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.660
Were you guys the ones
who've been supplying me...

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:22.670
with information about demons
and pressured me to win auctions for them?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.920
We aren't.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.050
Of course not.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.510
I see.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.590
Sorry I doubted you.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:37.310
If you're already convinced, you should ask us
directly from the beginning, you coward!

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.890
But I mean if you found out
that I was doubting you,

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:45.020
you wouldn't collude with me in the future, right?
That would put me in trouble!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:49.780
There never was
and never will be any collusion.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:50.860
Got that?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:57.740
Pardon me. I will just say
I never heard any of that.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:05.630
<i>That would mean that the most suspicious
individual would be our head honcho.</i>

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.170
The director general?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.420
Well, we can't help it
if people suspect that individual.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.420
There's just too much mystery.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.680
<i>Exactly what kind of individual is it?</i>

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.140
<i>We just don't have a face
to attach to onsite.</i>

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:22.140
Don't worry. Even I have only gotten
written orders from said person.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.230
I am far from being able to meet face-to-face.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.570
Ever since taking the position two years ago,

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:32.280
nobody in the police, not even the deputy
director general, knows who it is. Not even a name.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.490
Every order is done remotely.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.620
I'm surprised the top member
of the police can function like that.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.200
But I can say this...

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:46.630
The current director general is a human
who detests demons the most in this city.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.840
I mean, when you first returned
toting a demon two years ago,

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.800
the director general,
who just took the position,

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:59.760
brute-forced the assignment of you
as a Demon Exterminator.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.020
Really?

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:05.560
Back then, the government
and the police had quite a squabble.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:09.770
Anyway, that individual's tenacity when it comes
to the destruction of Demon Hazards

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.570
is a bit over the top.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.070
Hey, Shu...

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.240
Are these really your only suspects?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.240
Aren't you overlooking something important?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.450
* Anti-Demon Bureau (Chief Ashiya)
* AAA (Akino Yugiri and Ayano Yugiri)

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.880
You came to meet me
without telling that demon?

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.640
No way I could do that.
She's outside.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.970
Try making any sort of lewd voice.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.850
She'll jump in and slice you in half.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.390
Along with me.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.060
Look at this.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:53.230
What's up with human rights in this city?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:58.200
Says the one who infringed upon
the human rights of the people of this city.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.370
So, what do you want?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.370
I saw a video of your interrogation.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.330
What is the demon
that'll descend onto this city?

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:12.000
Does it have something to do with the one
that we're trying to chase right now?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.880
You don't even remember that much?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.800
It must be true
that you're giving up your memories.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.600
I only give up memories that I don't need.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:26.480
She hasn't taken stuff about my family
or about the incident from 12 years ago.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:32.440
Memories are all connected into one.
It's impossible to completely cut them apart.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.690
That's not true!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.610
Even now, my parents and Kanna
are clear in my—

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.320
If you're asking about Asmodeus,

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.990
I told you that story
as pillow talk two years ago.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:44.790
Huh?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.160
See, it's been taken from you, right?
Of course it would.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:54.550
It was a memory engrained into you along with
the warmth of my skin, my smell and my touch.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:58.590
What exactly is this Asmodeus thing?

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:03.720
Once a tear in your memory expands,
your devotion also becomes sparse.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.430
In due time, you'll no longer feel anything.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:11.310
Your enemy, your family,
the women you've slept with...

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:16.190
You'll no longer show interest in anything
and end up living a peaceful life...

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:18.440
together with that demon.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.360
I didn't ask anything of that sort!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:28.370
You're currently chasing
after Asmodeus's puppet.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.410
Puppet...

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.000
The agent?

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.300
You guys are apparently calling him that.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.670
That guy is hiding among humans
and controlling the Demon Hazards in this city.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.930
I want to find that guy!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.550
Doesn't the Abbey have
some means of recognizing him?

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.810
Then I'll give you a hint.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.480
The arsonist is at the scene of the fire.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.480
Huh?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:58.320
Someone who wants to burn an entire city down
is not at each and every fire.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:02.820
However, someone who burns
one house at a time is always on the scene.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:09.290
Because the most important thing for him
is the location that he's igniting.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.290
Location? What does that mean—

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.540
That's all I can tell you for free.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.880
Detective Mikami!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.090
Mr. Mikami!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.810
I'm going to go home,
but are you going to keep at it?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.690
Something's just nagging me.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.360
As if I'm overlooking
something important.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.570
Is what Akino said still bothering you?

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.820
I feel like it threw me
all the way back to square one.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:47.320
Well, don't wreck your health
over it, okay? See you.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.080
Yeah. Thanks for the hard work.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:02.210
Only the people in higher ranks
could've circumvented me.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:08.050
Or they silenced them just in case,
and it happened at that particular timing?

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.680
No, it can't be
that convenient of a coincidence.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.610
Impossible!

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.990
Is such a thing...

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.500
Hello, Mr. Ogata? Actually—

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.710
<i>Connecting to voicemail. After the beep...</i>

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.680
VOICEMAIL
1 VOICEMAIL FROM TETSUYA MIKAMI

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:53.310
<i>Mikami here! I want to talk to you alone,
so I am heading over there!</i>

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.190
<i>I'm about to leave the station parking lot,
so I shouldn't need more than five— Oh!</i>

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.820
<i>I was one step too late, huh?</i>

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.620
TETSUYA MIKAMI
VOICEMAIL

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.130
No way...

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.960
Wait! It's me!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.550
Mikhail-senpai?

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.260
You're the one who killed Mr. Mikami!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.270
No way! I would never kill him!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.310
Because this is who I am!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.310
BAYRON CITY
POLICE AGENCY
DIRECTOR GENERAL
MIKHAIL HACHISUKA

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.520
You understand now, right?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:27.530
BAYRON CITY
POLICE AGENCY
DIRECTOR GENERAL
MIKHAIL HACHISUKA

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:27.530
I'm the highest authority for the upkeep
of Bayron City's peace and order!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.570
Now, calm down and disarm yourself—

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.950
I&S OFFICE
SHU OGATA

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.870
So you were the informant.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:40.710
Subject: About the case you inquired
About the D Hazard
which occurred at 15:55 today at
the Legeston Hotel Bayron.
We report to you
that 4 out of the 5
conditions your office
designated were met.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:41.460
MR. SHU OGATA

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:46.670
Just how many times do you think
I've helped you out to this day?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.090
I deserve appreciation, if anything. There's
no reason why I should be interrogated like this.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.890
I'd been suspecting those
involved with the government, as well.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.390
But I didn't think the scrappy youngest kid
was the actual perpetrator.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:05.230
The airheaded but popular Mikhail-senpai
you know is simply an act to fool the public.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.480
You thought you were acting
as someone popular?

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:15.070
We siblings all grew up with rigorous
special training from our grandfather.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:18.200
To be honest, the most useless member
of the Hachisuka family is—

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.200
That doesn't matter at all!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.580
Why did you kill Mr. Mikami?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.120
How many times do I have to tell you?
I didn't kill—

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:27.290
Tempting people and turning them
into the Demonically Possessed!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.920
Sending this city into chaos!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.470
What exactly are you trying to do?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.340
No, no, no!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:38.350
Jeez, pull that gun away!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:45.150
This is my girlfriend and her pal.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.690
I promised I'd show them
around the city hall.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:57.580
So you really can clear the allegations
against you if we come here?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.830
Just shut up and follow me.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.290
That mastermind you all have been after...

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.420
We don't know the identity
of that guy, either.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.380
AUTHENTICATED

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.760
However, those you listed as suspects...

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:19.050
My family, Ashiya and Ms. Akino Yugiri
have already had their suspicions cleared.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.220
So your investigation is back to square one.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.310
How can you say such a thing?

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:28.480
And before that,
how do you know so much?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.900
Because...

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:38.240
I keep watch over everyone's actions
and comments from here!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.200
- Man, you really are screwed up!
- Wow!

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.290
It's not a big deal.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:50.880
This city has surveillance cameras
set up all over the place to begin with,

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.170
so you can basically ascertain
the actions of everyone.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.670
It's just that...

00:17:55.670 --> 00:18:01.390
I was monitoring the several people you listed up
in real time as targets of further surveillance.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.310
That doesn't mean you should be peeking
into your big sisters during their baths!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.060
We're family!
Where's there a need for hesitation?

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.440
They'd kill you if they found out,
wouldn't they?

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.570
It's not just surveillance camera footage.
Smartphone GPS...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:22.080
internet usage history and phone conversation
information are also gathered here.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:27.210
That's why I deduced that Mikami
was the one closest to the truth,

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:30.210
and headed out there to contact him.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.800
What was that about a city of freedom?

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.760
This is a super-surveillance society!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.680
Bayron City guarantees personal freedom.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.680
However, all actions come with responsibility.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.930
If you cause any problems,
I will make sure you pay the price.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.020
Pulling up footage from
when Detective Mikami was murdered.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:59.160
He always has his back
to the surveillance cameras.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.280
Just like when Junya Hanamura
was murdered.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.210
Thanks for working so hard.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.340
This really tires me out.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:19.340
You should leave
stuff like this to the police.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:24.850
I have to clear Mr. Mikami's regrets.
I can't leave it in someone else's hands.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:33.190
There are three million surveillance cameras
set up within the city, including hidden cameras.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:37.860
All of them are fully operational
24 hours a day, 365 days a year.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:41.160
I didn't want to know
such horrible information.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:46.240
There's actually too much data
that video analysis can't keep up.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:49.870
They narrow it down a bit using AIs,

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.540
but in the end, they still have to rely
on human eyes and judgment.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.170
That's called "getting your priorities wrong."

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.670
And...

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:01.840
are you okay?

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.140
About what?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.850
About Mr. Mikami.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.600
It was a shock to you, right?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:11.480
You found someone for the first time in a while
who seriously cared about your vengeance.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.480
Right now, finding the perpetrator
is more important than lamenting.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:19.240
That's what Mr. Mikami would've done
if I was the one who was killed.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.950
You're right.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:27.120
- Stop!
- Huh?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.910
It can't be.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:59.690
I'll take you home. How about
we eat something on the way back?

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:16.210
You know, human life is all too short.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.130
Shu, you'd better be careful, you know.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:23.340
If they killed Mr. Mikami, it wouldn't come
as a surprise if you're a target, as well.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.590
You, too, old man.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.930
In any case, it still doesn't feel real.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.810
The three of us were running around
together until the other day.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:35.940
We even doubted our mayor.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:39.360
If you think about it,
that's a flagrant rebellion.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.360
We didn't do anything so terrible
to warrant being killed,

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.110
but we'd easily get demoted
for what we did.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:50.160
Mr. Mikami never showed any mercy
once he thought of something.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:54.370
I guess that's what you call
"a real detective."

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:58.670
But there were times he acted
a bit foolishly for a detective.

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:02.340
Right. He truly was a strange individual.

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:09.220
A man of justice who knew what was what,
but still was softhearted and gullible.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.850
Is that why you killed him, Miles?

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:20.860
Because he was softhearted
and easy to deceive?

00:23:55.580 --> 00:24:00.000
EPISODE 9
WITHOUT UNDERSTANDING THE TEARS SHED

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:00.000
"Without Understanding the Tears Shed."
